### ============================================================
### MATERIAL PURCHASES
### ============================================================

### 15. Get All Material Purchases
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/material-purchases
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### 16. Get Material Purchase by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/material-purchases/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### 17. Create Material Purchase (Admin only)
### Note: This will automatically update the material current_stock
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/material-purchases
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "tanggal": "2026-05-26",
  "material_id": "MAT001",
  "qty": 100,
  "harga_satuan": 5000
}

### 18. Update Material Purchase (Admin only)
### Note: Stock adjustment akan dilakukan otomatis berdasarkan qty lama dan baru
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/v1/material-purchases/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "tanggal": "2026-05-27",
  "material_id": "MAT001",
  "qty": 150,
  "harga_satuan": 4800
}

### 19. Delete Material Purchase (Super Admin only)
### Note: Stock akan dikurangi sesuai qty yang dihapus
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/material-purchases/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

